<v Ira Glass>[鸣谢]

00:56:37.530 --> 00:56:59.160
<v Ira Glass>Our website, thisamericanlife.org. This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange. Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. He says, sure, yes, it's true. He was found wearing a bathing suit standing out in the middle of the street in the middle of winter, in the middle of night, holding a quarter million dollars in cash that was not his.
<v Ira Glass>我们的网站，thisamericanlife.org。《美国生活》通过公共广播交换平台PRX传送给公共广播电台。和往常一样，感谢我们节目的联合创始人Torey Malatia先生。他说，当然，是的，是真的。人们发现他穿着泳衣站在冬夜街道中央，手里拿着不是他的四分之一百万美元现金。

00:56:59.160 --> 00:57:03.030
<v Paulette Kish>But that could happen to anyone. It can happen to anyone.
<v Paulette Kish>但这可能发生在任何人身上。它可能发生在任何人身上。

00:57:03.030 --> 00:57:08.030
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life .
<v Ira Glass>我是Ira Glass。下周回来，带来更多《美国生活》的故事。
